meta {
  name: Collection Records (Detailed)
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/orders/collection-records?statuses=ORDER,APPOINTMENT,CANCELLED&dimension=all&page=1&limit=20
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  statuses: ORDER,APPOINTMENT,CANCELLED
  dimension: all
  page: 1
  limit: 20
  ~branchId: {{branchId}}
  ~dateFrom: 2026-07-01
  ~dateTo: 2026-07-31
  ~paymentMode: UPI
  ~search: john
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{businessAccessToken}}
}

docs {
  Paginated detailed Collection records for the active tab (`dimension` — same set
  as Billing, incl. `int-ref-user` / `ext-ref-user` / `outsource` / `discount` /
  `back-dated` / `advance-dated` / `home-collection`). Only orders that collected money. Each row
  carries the standard money fields plus the per-row payment-mode breakdown
  (`cash` / `upi` / `bankTransfer` / `debitCard` / `creditCard`), where
  `paid = cash + upi + bankTransfer + debitCard + creditCard`. `discountAmount`
  includes both order-level and per-line-item discounts. For the item-level
  dimensions each row's figures are the sum of that order's allocated matching
  lines. `Σ records === collection-summary` for the same filters.
}
